    // dot_f32_x4 costs 5 loads per 4 FMAs (one activation, four weights).
    // Holding two activation columns makes it 6 loads per 8 FMAs, so the
    // load:FMA ratio drops from 1.25 to 0.75 and the kernel stops being load
